// Keyhive Lab Note #8 (https://www.inkandswitch.com/keyhive/notebook/08/), "Invocation": revocation voids an earlier edit
(Doc)-[admin(Doc)]->(Alice)
(Alice)-[edit(Doc)]->(Bob)
(Bob)=[[edit]]=>(Doc)   : Bob edits
bob-carol: (Bob)-[edit(Doc)]->(Carol)
(Carol)=[[edit]]=>(Doc) : Carol edits (void after the revocation)
(Alice)-<revoke>-x[bob-carol]
(Bob)=[[edit]]=>(Doc)   : Bob edits again
